  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When unarmored and unencumbered, the sage adds his Wisdom bonus (if any) to his AC and his CMD. In addition, a sage gains a +1 bonus to AC and CMD at 4th level. This bonus increases by 1 for every four sage levels thereafter, up to a maximum of +5 at 20th level.</p>\n<p>These bonuses to AC apply even against touch attacks or when the sage is flat-footed. He loses these bonuses when he is immobilized or helpless, when he wears any armor, when he carries a shield, or when he carries a medium or heavy load.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/sage#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
